* 1N4742A 12 V, 1 W zener diode (Diodes Incorporated model)
* Source: https://github.com/kicad-spice-library/KiCad-Spice-Library/blob/a8688952bcaab19f567bc4db237b60bde03ef310/Models/Diode/zener.lib
.SUBCKT 1N4742A  1 2
*        Terminals    A   K
D1 1 2 DF
DZ 3 1 DR
VZ 2 3 10.9
.model DF D(is=34.3p rs=0.620 n=1.10 cjo=94.2p vj=1.00 m=0.330 tt=50.1n)
.model DR D(is=6.87f rs=0.550 n=1.49)
.ENDS
